    "final_response_text": "The products most urgently at risk of stock-outs are:\n\n1. **Chef Anton's Gumbo Mix** - No stock or orders.\n2. **Alice Mutton** - No stock or orders.\n3. **Th\u00fcringer Rostbratwurst** - No stock or orders.\n4. **Perth Pasties** - No stock or orders.\n5. **Nord-Ost Matjeshering** - 10 units in stock, reorder level is 15.\n6. **Outback Lager** - 15 units in stock, reorder level is 30, with 10 units on order.\n\nThese products have stock levels at or below their reorder levels, indicating a risk of stock-out.",
