    "question": "How does average order value differ across customer countries?",
    "status": "success",
    "http_status": 200,
    "latency_ms_total": 4609,
    "error": null,
    "final_response_text": "The average order value varies significantly across customer countries. Here are some highlights:\n\n- Austria has the highest average order value at approximately 1,116.\n- Ireland follows with an average order value of about 1,042.\n- The USA and Germany have similar average order values, around 749 and 746, respectively.\n- Argentina has one of the lowest average order values at approximately 239.\n\nThese values reflect the average revenue generated per order in each country.",
